ut if our system works  then we can export that technology and  we will be able to  reconstruct frescoes that nowadays are  just stored into store rooms the project  is expected to take four years but  that's only the blink of an eye for  patient historians redmond shannon  global news london  and that is global national for this  monday night i'm jeff semple tonight's  year canada is this month's big truck  parade in downtown campbell river bc we  love seeing your canada so please keep  sending us your festive photos to  viewers at globalnational.com thanks for  watching hope to see you back here again  tomorrow have a great night  [Music]
 

